<title>USA: Datascope Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Datascope Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVALE, N.J. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months Ended	9 Months Ended(A)</p>
<p>		    3/31/97     3/31/96     3/31/97	3/31/96</p>
<p>Net Sales  $57,900,000 $54,600,000 $163,100,000 $152,800,000 Earnings Before</p>
<p>Litigation Settlements</p>
<p>		  5,750,000   5,437,000   12,601,000   13,378,000</p>
<p>Litigation Settlement</p>
<p>(Expense) Income(A)</p>
<p>			   --	    --  (5,098,000)    7,872,000</p>
<p> Net Earnings 5,750,000   5,437,000    7,503,000   21,250,000</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>			 0.35	  0.33	   0.46	   1.28</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>Before Litigation</p>
<p>   Settlements     0.35	  0.33	   0.77	   0.81</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common</p>
<p>Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>		 16,544,000  16,602,000   16,349,000   16,556,000</p>
<p>NOTES: (A) Earnings for nine months 1997 period includes charges $8,554,000 or $5,098,000 after taxes, equivalent to $0.31 per share. Breakdown of charges is as follows:</p>
<p>(1) Shareholder class action settlement $5,550,000, or $3,291,000 after tax, equivalent to $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>(2) Patent infringement settlement $3,004,000, or $1,807,000 after income tax, equivalent to $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>Earnings for nine months 1996 includes special income $10,691,000, or $7,872,000 after income tax, equivalent to $0.47 per share, resulting from settlement of litigation against several former employees and certain other defendants.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
